From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 20:32:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] melon-packed-3 lists and Juice once per distinct pay and
 places (behaviour-identical)

Lists: row arrays, salary extras and range tuples, salary.text by reference,
url templates; Amazon's 5,000 470 -> 314 kB gzip, parse+unpack 50 -> 37 ms
(node). The build checks every list unpacks exactly as melon-packed-2 did;
test/perf-mobile-beta-2.test.js compares with a verbatim copy of the 31ad25b
code. getJobs copies Juice to postings that repeat a pay and places, in time
slices. external-links and betaLeaks decode the new format.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014jaqot5Ddmi7Co6CofBiyc
